# Review routing. Branch protection does not REQUIRE a review on this
# repository — it requires the `ci gate` check — so this file requests one
# rather than enforcing it. It matters as soon as a second person has push
# access: without it an outside contribution can sit with nobody named on it.
#
# GitHub never requests review from the author of a pull request, so a
# single-maintainer repository sees no self-requests from this.
